@startuml
actor "Wali Kelas" as Wali
participant "View (Browser)" as View
participant "AbsensiSiswaController" as Controller
participant "Siswa (Model)" as ModelSiswa
participant "AbsensiSiswa (Model)" as ModelAbsen

Wali -> View : Membuka Menu Absensi Kelas
View -> Controller : GET /wali/absensi-kelas
Controller -> ModelSiswa : Dapatkan daftar siswa di kelas
ModelSiswa --> Controller : List Siswa
Controller --> View : Tampilkan tabel daftar siswa

Wali -> View : Ubah status tiap siswa (H/S/I/A) & Simpan
View -> Controller : POST /wali/absensi-kelas (data absensi)
Controller -> ModelAbsen : insert_data() / update_data() (Bulk)
ModelAbsen --> Controller : Berhasil menyimpan
Controller --> View : Notifikasi "Data Tersimpan"
View --> Wali : Update tampilan tabel
@enduml
